        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n10 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a 26 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (plus, on a critical failure, slowed 1 as long as it's sickened). While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "dbef5a6e-4751-4bea-91a8-6c544a829278",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.415400"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Ghast Fever"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Ghast Fever**\nDC: 26\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: carrier with no ill effect (1 day)\n- Stage 2: 3d8 negative damage and regains half as many Hit Points from all healing (1 day)\n- Stage 3: as stage 2 (1 day)\n- Stage 4: 3d8 negative damage and gains no benefit from healing (1 day)\n- Stage 5: as stage 4 (1 day)\n- Stage 6: dead, and rises as a ghast the next midnight."
            },
            "id": "1a949723-3e63-4074-8594-aa72aa344aa1",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.415400"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Mauler"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A ghastly bear gains a +4 circumstance bonus to damage rolls against creatures it has grabbed."
            },
            "id": "7f25b755-571e-45bb-9c4a-d888170c0fb9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:01.415400"
            }
